{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>卓悅控股向兩名投資者配股集資約676萬元。</p><p></p><p>每股配售價1.434元，較上日收市價折讓逾百分之7，配售總共超過471萬股新股，佔已擴大發行股本百分之7。集資所得用於業務發展計劃及一般營運資金。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T00:19:56.445208+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T23:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T02:37:57.754992+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T00:17:49.487357+00:00","content_hash":"5d2773c4c1398e4bde424e999679e512354235b420fc71cc1da73da19cc8a724","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}